{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_176","t":"15 OF 20","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#176","p":8,"im":["0a4c028bbc26cff97316ae1d1f41fa05c300d4d7"],"m":176},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_177","t":"16 OF 20\n\nIs this how these should be drawn? It seems a bit confusing like this","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#177","p":8,"im":["740b6fa3244cc084ff14e485e3682997f76054fb"],"m":177},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_178","t":"As an exercise to train your eye on price, these are great.\n\nOnce your eyes get really accustomed to price, you'll see them all on a naked chart","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#178","p":8,"im":[],"m":178},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_179","t":"17 OF 20","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#179","p":8,"im":["e0813fc5b240ae47720e35fd5408adb7683a664e"],"m":179},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_180","t":"Ok guys, quite new at this, having observed some other threads, i've decided to try this RDB, DBR, DBD & RBR. I've tried to identify the levels that quite jump out and stare at you from the charts. As usual with my charts, everything is written on them. The rectangles are used to identify the \"bases\" i.e decision levels.\n\nguys, gimme your take on this.\n\nBest Regards, spring","a":"Springger","d":"","n":"#180","p":8,"im":["3523f312762e0b6ad77288a0d2ea9d1baec060c1"],"m":180},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_181","t":"uceego\n\nHi all,\n\nHere is my RBD/DBR homework, all comments are welcome\n\nCheers, Uceego\n\nEURUSD Daily:","a":"—","d":"","n":"#181","p":8,"im":["800b3c5cf60571ed6a1259144ac057f067e01e20"],"m":181},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_182","t":"hi gilben,\n\nThis is really helpful, Thanks","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#182","p":8,"im":[],"m":182},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_183","t":"AUDUSD Daily:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#183","p":8,"im":["5d7f265e48f6b7153f6886d6487cbaa2537bf3b5"],"m":183},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_184","t":"GBPUSD Daily:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#184","p":8,"im":["bf7e0c3966765e161ad371d54a2e8eb8b8d6d33c"],"m":184},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_185","t":"USDCAD H4:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#185","p":8,"im":["7707540a57f02cbe79eccac67714cbdc315c8d0b"],"m":185},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_186","t":"Hi Uceego,\n\nvery nice work you're doing here. Keep it going!\n\nI draw some other levels I saw on your last chart, if it serves to you. As the market is infact just a succession of RBD and DBR, it's impossible to mark everyone. But I signaled some more I found strong","a":"okami","d":"","n":"#186","p":8,"im":["9c26bd9415524d43957c937272a2a73341ae4517"],"m":186},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_187","t":"Thank you so much Okami","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#187","p":8,"im":[],"m":187},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_188","t":"NZDUSD H4:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#188","p":8,"im":["ba85e1b9282d09f4a973fd2c879f8ecd79cbfb93"],"m":188},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_189","t":"EURJPY H4:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#189","p":8,"im":["8ccbdc4211a5d031df7f202148db80a50f6981c2"],"m":189},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_190","t":"EURGBP H4:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#190","p":8,"im":["16fb7b6f1bfa85943e30d20e7ebd970d2987c82f"],"m":190},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_191","t":"USDCHF D1:","a":"uceego","d":"","n":"#191","p":8,"im":["7c4498773208c28137ba47d9d7fa85cb5dc04e6a"],"m":191},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_192","t":"DBR. Demand level held as support.before price broke the support.","a":"pipextract","d":"","n":"#192","p":8,"im":[],"m":192},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_193","t":"","a":"pipextract","d":"","n":"#193","p":8,"im":["be31fad22b702e59d2340164d1fb5e574c743309"],"m":193},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_195","t":"Hi Pip,\n\nI looked at your homework like you requested. I have marked a few things on your chart. Sorry if looks messy but had to use different colors to highlight things.\n\nIf you have any question, do not hesitate to ask.\n\nBest, Mel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#195","p":8,"im":["34b4f79a79fcb29fad4dc74a230bac6cd67a9bbc"],"m":195},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_196","t":"Hi Guys, This my training section only for RDB/DBR.IF said at least 200 so my target is 200 training examples for this subject. I'll focusing: 1.train my eyes find these zones 2.try to find most these levels on each example(ignoring fact if they worked or not,how price reaching these levels etc.) 3.try to reach target 200 exampl. 4.try to play just for fun how my levels will work in r;r=1;1-This is just more fun as all that is after fact etc.so all No's will be only aprox. Thanks for reading and every comment is welcome.","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#196","p":8,"im":[],"m":196},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_197","t":"Here is first example. these no's are here just having more fun with HW:))\n\n19 - RBD/DBR ZONES 7/9-not tested 4-not play my funny 1;1 trades Result: 16-zones 7-winners 2-0.5R 5-ignored.\n\n6-S/R (flip zones) 5-winners 1-0.5R","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#197","p":8,"im":["8db9b5536327b6f9240ba39bc68a41e52bdf1d6c"],"m":197},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_198","t":"2-200 Result: 21-zones 12-respected 7-ignored(they respected as a S/R zones) 2-not tested 8-S/R zones(respected)","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#198","p":8,"im":["99ed6716071c6377eb31376604b5cef67a51a03f"],"m":198},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_199","t":"That's a great study, RK\n\nI hope others try it this way too\n\nBest\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#199","p":8,"im":[],"m":199},{"id":"dbrrbd_p8_200","t":"3-200 23-RBD/DBR zones 4 zones=not tested 7 zone =not count to my 1:1 play 8 zones=respected 2zones=0.5 8 zones=ignored\n\n8 S/R zones 7 zones =respected 1 zone=ignored","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#200","p":8,"im":["ec46a082e4c36cd9a05ffdf267ca1a83738cf373"],"m":200}],"images":[{"k":"0a4c028bbc26cff97316ae1d1f41fa05c300d4d7","t":"assets/thumbs/0a4c028bbc26cff97316ae1d1f41fa05c300d4d7.webp","f":"assets/images/0a4c028bbc26cff97316ae1d1f41fa05c300d4d7.jpeg","w":1500,"h":759,"b":55234,"o":"0a4c028bbc26cff97316ae1d1f41fa05c300d4d7.jpeg","p":8,"pid":"dbrrbd_p8_176"},{"k":"740b6fa3244cc084ff14e485e3682997f76054fb","t":"assets/thumbs/740b6fa3244cc084ff14e485e3682997f76054fb.webp","f":"assets/images/740b6fa3244cc084ff14e485e3682997f76054fb.jpeg","w":1500,"h":757,"b":63698,"o":"740b6fa3244cc084ff14e485e3682997f76054fb.jpeg","p":8,"pid":"dbrrbd_p8_177"},{"k":"e0813fc5b240ae47720e35fd5408adb7683a664e","t":"assets/thumbs/e0813fc5b